==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]], [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Red Wind]] (75%) spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (75%) spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (75%) spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Red Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Red Wind]]s (75%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Red Wind]]s (75%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A stupidly easy stage. Even with the restriction of only using the [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA Collaboration]] units, the enemies serve practically no threat at all. However, it is recommended to have them at least at level 1+5 so that they have some survivability.

